"name": "Einhell Germany AG",
"description": "Einhell Germany AG engages in the manufacture and sale of electronic tools, electrical tool accessories, metal, and plastic products for garden and leisure activities. It operates through the following segments: Tools, and Garden and Leisure. Its products include hand-held power tools, stationary machines and accessories as well as lawn and garden care tools, and irrigation and drainage solutions. The company was founded by Josef Thannhuber in 1964 and is headquartered in Landau an der Isar, Germany.",
